lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-1-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion false ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-1 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "1. Article 82(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 April 2016 on the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data and on the free movement of such data, and repealing Directive 95/46/EC (General Data Protection Regulation)must be interpreted as meaning that the mere infringement of the provisions of that regulation is not sufficient to confer a right to compensation."@en .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-1-q1-german
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:languageVersionOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-1-q1 ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-1 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source-german ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/GE/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "1. Art. 82 Abs. 1 der Verordnung (EU) 2016/679 des Europäischen Parlaments und des Rates vom 27. April 2016 zum Schutz natürlicher Personen bei der Verarbeitung personenbezogener Daten, zum freien Datenverkehr und zur Aufhebung der Richtlinie 95/46/EG (Datenschutz-Grundverordnung)ist dahin auszulegen,dass der bloße Verstoß gegen die Bestimmungen dieser Verordnung nicht ausreicht, um einen Schadenersatzanspruch zu begründen."@german .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2
    a lgo:Provision ;
    eli:is_part_of lg:CJEU-C-300-21 ;
    lgo:citation "C-300/21 Österreichische Post, ruling 2" ;
    lgo:interprets lg:EU-2016-679-art82-1 ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:SourceChecked ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[2]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion false ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[2]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "2. Article 82(1) of Regulation 2016/679must be interpreted as precluding a national rule or practice which makes compensation for non-material damage, within the meaning of that provision, subject to the condition that the damage suffered by the data subject has reached a certain degree of seriousness."@en .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2-q1-german
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:languageVersionOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2-q1 ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-2 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source-german ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[2]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/GE/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "2. Art. 82 Abs. 1 der Verordnung 2016/679ist dahin auszulegen,dass er einer nationalen Regelung oder Praxis entgegensteht, die den Ersatz eines immateriellen Schadens im Sinne dieser Bestimmung davon abhängig macht, dass der der betroffenen Person entstandene Schaden einen bestimmten Grad an Erheblichkeit erreicht hat."@german .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3
    a lgo:Provision ;
    eli:is_part_of lg:CJEU-C-300-21 ;
    lgo:citation "C-300/21 Österreichische Post, ruling 3" ;
    lgo:interprets lg:EU-2016-679-art82-1 ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:SourceChecked ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[3]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion false ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[3]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "3. Article 82 of Regulation 2016/679must be interpreted as meaning that for the purposes of determining the amount of damages payable under the right to compensation enshrined in that article, national courts must apply the domestic rules of each Member State relating to the extent of financial compensation, provided that the principles of equivalence and effectiveness of EU law are complied with."@en .

lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3-q1-german
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:languageVersionOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3-q1 ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:CJEU-C-300-21-ruling-3 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:CJEU-C-300-21-source-german ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/JUDGMENT/CONTENTS.JUDGMENT[1]/JURISDICTION[1]/LIST[1]/ITEM[3]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/GE/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62021CJ0300"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "3. Art. 82 der Verordnung 2016/679ist dahin auszulegen,dass die nationalen Gerichte bei der Festsetzung der Höhe des Schadenersatzes, der aufgrund des in diesem Artikel verankerten Schadenersatzanspruchs geschuldet wird, die innerstaatlichen Vorschriften der einzelnen Mitgliedstaaten über den Umfang der finanziellen Entschädigung anzuwenden haben, sofern die unionsrechtlichen Grundsätze der Äquivalenz und der Effektivität beachtet werden."@german .

